# Previous Deities
Daglir's Predeccessor

%%
With the Passing of Daglir's Predeccessor and the ascension of Daglir and Yara, the pantheon is complete for the first time ever. It is the most recent ascension since the passing of Shaagi and the ascension of [[romis|Romis]] in the early Decemvir Era.
